abstract: >-
  Analysis-ready multi-session baseline-voltage recordings from a 25-channel
  SnO2 gas sensor array, including environmental measurements, fixed row roles,
  historical per-row predictions and chronological score tables supporting
  peer-assisted residual calibration.
keywords:
  - SnO2
  - gas sensor array
  - baseline voltage
  - cross-session calibration
  - temperature and humidity
